<td id="A1.T7.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Gaze point (pixel coordinate) at time <math id="A1.T7.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
